# 1. Purpose

The Engineering Acquisition Wizard provides the primary user workflow for importing engineering knowledge into OEP.

Its purpose is to guide engineers through the acquisition process while automatically maintaining the Engineering Chain of Custody (ECOC) for every acquired artifact.

The wizard abstracts the internal acquisition architecture while educating the engineer on each stage of the process.

---

# 2. Design Philosophy

The engineer should never need to understand:

- Official Sources
- Acquisition Jobs
- Reference Vault
- Candidate Knowledge Objects

Those are implementation details.

Instead the engineer should experience:

Acquire Knowledge

↓

Review

↓

Approve

↓

Publish

